    "title": "Women's March Madness schedule, how to watch Final Four games Friday",
    "text": "April 3, 2026, 7:00 a.m. MTThe Women's NCAA Tournament Final Four round starts today with a matchup between Connecticut and South Carolina. It concludes with a game between UCLA and Texas.How can you watch each Women's March Madness Final Four game today?Here's a look at the TV information for each Final Four NCAA Tournament women's basketball game on Friday, April 3, with the teams, scheduled game time, channel and streaming information.All times MST (add three hours for Eastern time).The games are being played at Mortgage Matchup Center in Phoenix.How to watch Women's Final Four: South Carolina vs UConn | Texas vs UCLA | UConn vs South Carolina TV | UCLA vs Texas TV | Schedule | TV channels | Game times | Announcers | Who is in Final Four? | Final Four ticketsWatch Women's Final Four games on FUBO (free trial)Women's March Madness schedule today: Final Four games on Friday4 p.m.: No. 1 South Carolina vs No. 1 UConn, ESPN (stream with free trial from FUBO)6:30 p.m.: No. 1 Texas vs No. 1 UCLA, ESPN (stream with free trial from FUBO)Women's Final Four odds: South Carolina vs UConn | Texas vs UCLA | UConn vs South Carolina betting | UCLA vs Texas betting | Betting odds | National championship oddsWomen's Final Four picks: South Carolina vs UConn | Texas vs UCLA | UConn vs South Carolina score | UCLA vs Texas score | The Republic's predictions | Win probabilitiesReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
